{"_schema":"rp-character-volume-v1","world":"campione","character_id":"lucretia-zola","volume":"vol-13","periods":[{"period_id":"vol-13-main","volume":"vol-13","name":{"zh":"璐克蕾琪雅·索拉"},"aliases":["萨丁岛魔女","婆婆"],"summary":"与爱丽丝在巴塞隆纳追问亚雷克关于最后之王候补的推论，并在终章致电告知喀耳刻被护堂击败、奥德修斯并非最后之王。她继续作为最后之王情报线的老练魔女中介。","sourceRef":"campione-main/vol-13/chapters/ch-009-终章.txt","type":"witch"}],"source_refs":["campione-main/vol-13/chapters/ch-001-序章.txt","campione-main/vol-13/chapters/ch-009-终章.txt"]}